+// Hidden target-side probes authored by BATCH-F2P-0003.
+//
+// Each test below corresponds to one contract requirement / F2P observation and
+// asserts the same semantic predicate that the source (Rust) implementation
+// fails and the target (Go) implementation must satisfy. All network access is
+// served by local httptest servers; no external AWS endpoint is contacted.
